    {
      "id": "BattleFactoryScene_Text_FactoryHeadApproaching",
      "en_US": [
        "Congratulations to you, Trainer!\r",
        "In recognition of your outstanding\n",
        "winning streak, our Frontier Brain is\f",
        "demanding a match with you.\r",
        "So, your next match is against the\n",
        "Factory Head with no right of refusal!\r",
        "Are you prepared?\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Félicitations, Dresseur!\r",
        "Inspiré par vos victoires successives,\n",
        "notre Meneur de Zone a décidé de\f",
        "vous affronter en personne.\r",
        "Lors de votre prochain combat, vous\n",
        "devrez affronter notre Chef d’Usine!\r",
        "Serez-vous à la hauteur?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleFactoryScene_Text_ThortonIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Thorton: Bzweeeeep!\r",
        "Sorry, don’t mind me.\r",
        "What I’m using is an invention of mine.\n",
        "It’s my data-analyzing machine.\r",
        "It’s telling me what you’ve rented\n",
        "for this match.\r",
        "I see! You’ve rented {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0},\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}, and {STRVAR_1 0, 2, 0}.\r",
        "I have to say, that’s a good setup.\n",
        "Like, say, {STRVAR_1 51, 3, 0} percent?\f",
        "Oh, don’t let that number concern you!\r",
        "All righty, let’s get going!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Cardus: Analyse en cours...\r",
        "Oh, ne fais pas attention à moi.\r",
        "Je viens d’activer une de mes inventions\n",
        "géniales, un méta-analyseur composite.\r",
        "Ce petit bijou me permet de savoir avec\n",
        "précision quels Pokémon tu as avec toi.\r",
        "Je crois pouvoir affirmer que tu vas\n",
        "utiliser {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0}, {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}\f",
        "et {STRVAR_1 0, 2, 0} pour notre combat.\r",
        "Un choix intéressant. D’après mes\n",
        "calculs, tu as d’ailleurs {STRVAR_1 51, 3, 0}% de\f",
        "chances de remporter la victoire.\r",
        "Mais ne nous préoccupons pas des\n",
        "statistiques, concentrons-nous plutôt\f",
        "sur le combat. C’est parti!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleFactoryScene_Text_ThortonIntroGold",
      "en_US": [
        "Thorton: Bzweeeeep!\r",
        "Let’s see what I can see about you\n",
        "through my data-analyzing machine.\r",
        "So, what have you rented for this\n",
        "match...?\r",
        "I see! You’ve rented {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0},\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}, and {STRVAR_1 0, 2, 0}.\r",
        "I have to admit, that’s a good setup.\r",
        "It’s a combination of friendship with\n",
        "cooperation all around.\r",
        "I’d say it’s like {STRVAR_1 51, 3, 0} percent?\f",
        "Oh, don’t let that number concern you!\r",
        "All righty, let’s get going!\n",
        "No losing for me this time!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Cardus: Analyse en cours...\r",
        "Voyons ce que dit mon méta-analyseur\f",
        "composite cette fois-ci...\r",
        "Voyons voir quels Pokémon tu as choisis\n",
        "pour ce combat...\r",
        "Oh! Un choix inattendu...\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0}, {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0} et\f",
        "{STRVAR_1 0, 2, 0}, c’est ça?\r",
        "Cette combinaison présente des\n",
        "avantages tactiques indéniables.\r",
        "D’après mes calculs, tu as d’ailleurs\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 51, 3, 0}% de chances de gagner ce combat.\r",
        "Mais ne nous préoccupons pas des\n",
        "statistiques, concentrons-nous plutôt\f",
        "sur le combat.\r",
        "Je n’ai aucune intention de m’incliner\n",
        "cette fois!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleFactoryScene_Text_BeatThorton",
      "en_US": [
        "Thorton: Hmm...\n",
        "I got handed the loss here.\r",
        "It’s not making me happy at all, losing.\n",
        "Even though I’m not happy, I did glean\f",
        "some useful data, I suppose.\r",
        "That makes me glad I battled you.\r",
        "So, did you get to like those Pokémon\n",
        "you rented?\r",
        "As the Factory Head, it would sure make\n",
        "me happy if you did.\r",
        "Next time, come back with different\n",
        "rental Pokémon.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Cardus: Bien... Les résultats sont sans\n",
        "appel. Je m’incline.\r",
        "Cette défaite me rend perplexe, je vais\n",
        "devoir analyser à nouveau toutes les\f",
        "données de notre combat...\r",
        "Ceci dit, je suis content d’avoir eu\n",
        "l’occasion de t’affronter.\r",
        "Au fait, comment as-tu trouvé les\n",
        "Pokémon que tu as empruntés?\r",
        "En tant que Chef d’Usine, ton avis\n",
        "m’intéresse.\r",
        "Tu devrais essayer de choisir d’autres\n",
        "Pokémon la prochaine fois, pour voir.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleFactoryScene_Text_BeatThortonGold",
      "en_US": [
        "Thorton: Hmm...\n",
        "I got handed another loss.\r",
        "It’s not making me happy at all, this.\n",
        "In fact, I’m stewing here.\r",
        "I thought I learned a lot about\n",
        "Pokémon since I lost to you.\r",
        "But that’s all right.\n",
        "Some things you learn from winning.\f",
        "But some things you learn by losing.\r",
        "I hope you’ll keep renting our Pokémon\n",
        "and give me a chance to redeem myself!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Cardus: Bien... Une fois de plus, les\n",
        "résultats sont sans appel. Je m’incline.\r",
        "Cette défaite me rend perplexe, j’avais\n",
        "pourtant analysé en détail toutes les\f",
        "données de notre dernier combat...\r",
        "J’étais pourtant sûr d’avoir tiré\n",
        "les bonnes conclusions...\r",
        "Enfin bref, j’essaierai de voir cette\n",
        "nouvelle défaite comme une occasion de\f",
        "parfaire mes connaissances...\r",
        "J’espère que tu continueras à\n",
        "emprunter nos Pokémon et qu’on aura\f",
        "à nouveau l’occasion de s’affronter!\r"
      ]
    }
